<title>CANADA: CWB details 1995/96 wheat, barley credit sales.</title>
<headline>CWB details 1995/96 wheat, barley credit sales.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Wheat Board</p>
<p>detailed Wednesday credit sales in the 1995/96 (Aug/July) crop</p>
<p>year.</p>
<p>	   CWB WHEAT AND DURUM EXPORTS UNDER CREDIT AGREEMENTS</p>
<p>Country		Tonnage	  10-yr Avg</p>
<p>Brazil		 264,000 tonnes 388,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Iran		   806,000 tonnes 282,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Russia		 n/a		n/a</p>
<p>World Total:     1,070,000	3,294,000 tonnes</p>
<p>	   CWB BARLEY EXPORTS UNDER CREDIT AGREEMENTS</p>
<p>Iran		    53,000 tonnes   5,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Russia		  n/a		 n/a</p>
<p>World Total:	  53,000 tonnes 333,000 tonnes</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
